# /resume: after a fresh start, pick the earlier session from the picker.
name: resume-picker
size: 100x30
args: --permission-mode default
prompt: Remember a word for me
files: ../../../testdata/fixtures/12/app
script: scripts/resume.json
parity: SE-11, SE-12, SE-07
---
ready
wait_for 30s kumquat
settle
restart
ready 20s
settle 3s
type /resume
keys enter
settle 4s
checkpoint picker
keys enter
wait_for 30s Remember the word kumquat.
settle 3s
checkpoint resumed
